  "description": "Sun Mooyoung, a struggling fake fortune-teller, cons clueless chaebol heir Lee Jaeyi, who’s never dated, into a bogus love reading and rakes in big cash. But when Jaeyi realizes he’s been scammed, he sues Mooyoung for the fraudster he is! As if that’s not bad enough, Mooyoung’s boyfriend bails on him after hearing about the lawsuit. Now broke and desperate, Mooyoung hatches a ridiculous plan: make Jaeyi's fake love fortune come true to get the charges dropped. Can this hapless con artist pull off a miracle—or just dig himself deeper?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
